        <item>
            <title>0.6.57</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 15:09:31 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.57</link>
            <sparkle:version>90</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.57</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.57

- Meeting summaries now preserve explicit commitments and requested tasks in Next steps, even when Apple Intelligence incorrectly says none were stated.
- Includes the separate Meetings library, one-click private meeting summaries, and bounded routine dictation history introduced in 0.6.56.
]]></description>
